<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Packers and Movers in Bokaro Cost Guide | 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors most influence the Packers And Movers Bokaro Cost Guide for a 3 BHK house shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost is shaped by the total volume of goods, distance travelled, type of packing material, insurance coverage, and any special handling required for fragile items. Seasonal demand, access constraints at origin or destination, and the chosen service tier (standard vs. premium) also adjust the final quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I compare IBA approved packers and movers in Greater Noida for a relocation to Bokaro?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Start by verifying the IBA approval number on each company&#039;s website, then request detailed quotes that break down packing, loading, transit, and insurance fees. Compare fleet capabilities, customer reviews, and whether they provide live GPS tracking. Finally, check for hidden charges such as stair‑case surcharges or extra mileage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is shipping a bike parcel by train cheaper than using a dedicated carrier for a Bokaro move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Generally, train parcels have lower base rates, especially for long distances, but you must factor in handling fees, insurance, and last‑mile delivery charges. A dedicated carrier offers door‑to‑door service and quicker transit, which may justify the higher price if you need speed or extra safety.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How many hours do movers and packers typically need to pack and move furniture for a 3 BHK house in Bokaro?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a standard 3 BHK, professional teams usually require 6‑8 hours for packing, loading, and securing items, and an additional 4‑6 hours for unloading and unpacking at the destination. Complex items like modular kitchens or heavy wardrobes can add extra time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for e‑Way bill compliance during a Delhi to Mumbai transit via NH 19?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You must provide a valid GSTIN, invoice or bill of supply, vehicle registration details, and the exact weight of goods. The e‑Way bill is generated online, includes the transporter’s PAN, and must be displayed in the vehicle throughout the journey on NH 19.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I obtain a flat‑rate residential professional mover quote for shifting from Malad West to Bokaro?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, many movers offer a flat‑rate package for long‑distance residential moves. Request a quote that lists a single price covering packing, loading, transit, insurance, and unloading. Ensure the quote specifies any exclusions, such as extra stairs, elevator usage, or oversized items.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there hidden charges I should watch for in the transparent Packers And Movers Bokaro Cost Guide?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Watch for extra fees like stair‑case or elevator surcharges, additional mileage beyond the quoted distance, premium insurance for high‑value items, and charges for disassembly or re‑assembly of furniture. A reputable mover will disclose all these items upfront in the cost guide.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
